  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "身心靈秘境——泰安溫泉"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>沈雨璇</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">隱藏tī苗栗iap-thiap ê山內，一个身心靈安定ê秘境——泰安溫泉。伊ê suí是千言萬語sueh不盡。為著伊，hân-bān ê我，激破頭殼寫出一首藏頭詩，ǹg望逐家多多指導。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>泰安溫泉通人知，</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>安心安身koh安靈，</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>溫泉泉質世界讚，</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>泉水hōo lán血路順，</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>第一封號無hau-siâu，</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>一粒一ê美人湯，</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>等待逐家來tshit-thô。</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">俗諺講：「大人愛趁錢，囡仔愛過年。」正港是「一人興一項，無人興sio-siāng。」若beh hōo你tī充滿多元文化（客家、Ho̍h-ló、Saisiyat〈『賽夏』〉、新住民等）參自然景觀tsiok豐富ê苗栗縣，ài你揣一搭你上kah意ê所在，借問，你ē揀佗一位--leh？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">是生產甜but-but葡萄ê卓蘭？是規家伙仔鬥陣挽紅kì-kì參酸甜仔酸甜ê草莓生產地——大湖？是生產khiū-teh-teh、hōo人食了「心涼脾土開」ê仙草故鄉——仙山？Iah是hit搭三五好友sio招、規陣做伙騎舊山線孔明車，m̄-nā ē-tàng探討歷史古蹟龍騰斷橋，mā thìng好ná行ná欣賞有濟濟頭手木雕藝師創意作品ê三義--leh？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">啊無，kám是逐家beh坐時空機，tńg去早前山跤ê日式建築se̍h-se̍h--leh，lán ē-sái了解古早ê建築技術，koh順suà學習按怎編織鹹草。食上kài tshinn-tshioh koh營養ê魚丸，配「頂港有名聲，下港上出名」hit兩擔——藏tī苑裡菜市仔內底ê豆乾參tsìnn雞排？&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">若講著苗栗好食參好tshit-thô ê所在，真正是濟kah ná貓仔毛。阿娘uê--啊！實在有影m̄-thang koh繼續紹介--落-去，我ê喙瀾已經流bē煞--ah。好朋友--啊！論真講--來，我家己上意愛苗栗佗一个所在--leh？免講mā是hōo人感覺輕鬆自在，又koh thang消tháu身心靈ê秘境——泰安溫泉。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無m̄-tio̍h，台灣各地特色ê「溫泉泉質」是百百款，可比：宜蘭礁溪、台北陽明山、台東知本、屏東旭海參四重溪溫泉、台南關仔嶺、蘇澳冷泉、花蓮瑞穗溫泉、南澳碧侯溫泉等等。對我tsit个「興溫泉」ê痟人來講，頂面所講ê每一个溫泉區，我早就lóng朝聖--過--ah。凡勢你不止仔好玄，想beh問--我：台灣有hiah濟溫泉區，是按怎獨獨泰安溫泉hōo我呵咾kah tak舌？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">頭起先，tsit搭hōo青翠ê群山包圍，三不五時koh雲煙飄渺，bē輸是「世外桃源」。若tuì阮khang-khuè場出發，駛車到溫泉區，目一nih就到--ah，根本無需要偌久時間。致使，若發覺家己身軀有淡薄仔koh-iūnn，筋骨ân-ân iah是小可仔痠疼痠疼，車thìng好隨駛--過-去，mā tsiah倚半點鐘跤兜就赴市--őo。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Koh來，lán若khah tsia̍p去仝一个溫泉區，tiānn-tiānn ē認bat真濟仝興tsit味ê「湯友」。逐家是無分東西南北，你一句、我一聲，親像久年無見面ê換帖，m̄-nā分享各種養生撇步，連厝內大細漢ê生活趣味代，你mā ē bat kah有賰。橫直，發生tī日常生活中ê ta̍p-ta̍p-tih-tih，逐家是ná放鬆leh浸溫泉，ná歡喜leh開講phò-tāu。Tse kám m̄是現代人消tháu壓力ê好方法--leh？Mā thìng好講是「一兼二顧，摸lâ仔兼洗褲。」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Iáu有，浸溫泉ē-tàng養生參伊ê醫學療效，mā lóng是有科學根據，koh詳細記載tī醫學期刊頂kuân。不而過，若beh去浸溫泉ê時，有小可代誌lán iáu是ài斟酌hām細膩。親像，若本身有心臟病、高血壓、空腹、lim酒了後，iah是查某人來洗ê時，就千萬m̄-thang去浸。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">萬項代誌有優點mā一定有欠點。Lán tio̍h-ài照各地方浸溫泉ê例，m̄-thang家己想家己tio̍h。Lán ài維護參保持溫泉環境ê清氣kap sù-sī。啊！上重要ê代誌，beh浸溫泉進前，定著ài先洗浴，tsit點是上重要ê個人衛生問題。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">聽我án-ne kāu-kāu唸tsia-ê五四三，若講hōo破，kan-na深深ǹg望逐家，另日若來到tsit搭號做『慢活城鎮』ê苗栗縣。就千萬m̄-thang kan-na行跤花sì-kè凊彩se̍h-se̍h--leh niā-niā。我夭壽誠懇邀請逐家，一定ài去我推薦ê秘境——泰安溫泉。我敢搭胸坎koh掛保證：泰安溫泉絕對是一个hōo你身心靈完全放輕鬆ê所在。你若有機會來浸一kái世界級ê溫泉，一定ē hōo美人碳酸泉縛死死--őo！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">尾手，用老歲仔人tiānn講--ê：「趁錢有數，性命ài顧。」祝福逐家：合家平安！歡喜快活無煩惱，身體健康食百二。Koh再一擺邀請逐家，有閒就來苗栗縣ê泰安溫泉浸美人湯--őo！再會！</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span><a name='more'></a></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgT8BN5ZF1lbglOaXsb0lcKi0Ud0dbdTYWs6dt37K7HUZM9JZPbTE88-st1S2q8eqoj45udFxYFK7UWRxb8ciMtYCzNvVc4uHHYq2OUgNurAkPkYiEMVHrCddiZJF-fbR96_wWUFFU32OQ66hoRZPZ983UHw43ky7C0GuWgfs4qE_6emfimHmD_VG2oXafh/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1351%E6%9C%9F_27.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgT8BN5ZF1lbglOaXsb0lcKi0Ud0dbdTYWs6dt37K7HUZM9JZPbTE88-st1S2q8eqoj45udFxYFK7UWRxb8ciMtYCzNvVc4uHHYq2OUgNurAkPkYiEMVHrCddiZJF-fbR96_wWUFFU32OQ66hoRZPZ983UHw43ky7C0GuWgfs4qE_6emfimHmD_VG2oXafh/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1351%E6%9C%9F_27.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgocfDqKKlYzOpzo0nFe7Y8lLHXpDbiXI1z1U6P5xGBmBlriQrTxI8lIzw2BXubHGfvzAKfZrnQI4qlImuYK4ltDYErsS0Eyk00D318DvzuqW1ET47RHk__lAJcHt6yehAFI2G5cr_nq6JGhKP-gEYVtQL0QW7s6x3STTgqdKlpYhFxvw1VJOArLrnaGWey/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1351%E6%9C%9F_28.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgocfDqKKlYzOpzo0nFe7Y8lLHXpDbiXI1z1U6P5xGBmBlriQrTxI8lIzw2BXubHGfvzAKfZrnQI4qlImuYK4ltDYErsS0Eyk00D318DvzuqW1ET47RHk__lAJcHt6yehAFI2G5cr_nq6JGhKP-gEYVtQL0QW7s6x3STTgqdKlpYhFxvw1VJOArLrnaGWey/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1351%E6%9C%9F_28.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgjD5_l6xUD7retmBKB8wos7WRFknCak4GicPy6YeuPW7MytgdvGgESH2pfdKP9u6h00tKDFCnB85_K7ZNqEqfd3rAoaYReUCMn6rFdeH8_UpY4y6PqbTfC1likLf5IVSrGBYu9t7PSukqJ2taQL2_xZ1lqgLfAHkutfHuj5AbPuGepk4ZQsvu_84dN4c15/s1424/351%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgjD5_l6xUD7retmBKB8wos7WRFknCak4GicPy6YeuPW7MytgdvGgESH2pfdKP9u6h00tKDFCnB85_K7ZNqEqfd3rAoaYReUCMn6rFdeH8_UpY4y6PqbTfC1likLf5IVSrGBYu9t7PSukqJ2taQL2_xZ1lqgLfAHkutfHuj5AbPuGepk4ZQsvu_84dN4c15/w450-h640/351%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>#光景bóng uē&nbsp;專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap台羅。</b><br /><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: initial; border-width: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; cursor: pointer; display: inline; font-family: inherit; list-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: none; touch-action: manipulation;\" tabindex=\"0\">#台文通訊BONG報</a></span><span face=\"&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> 351期，2023年6月出刊。</span></b></span></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: medium; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\